Copyright 2026 Pavan D

This product includes software authored by Pavan D.

The fault-dictionary method and the "Faultiva" / CircuitSage-HMAC deep-learning
VLSI fault detection and localization system it derives from were designed and
built from scratch by Pavan D (https://github.com/pavannithin224-abcd). This
repository is an independent application layered on that idea and is not
affiliated with or endorsed by Endee (endee.io); it uses Endee as an external
vector-database component via its public client SDK.

ISCAS-85 benchmark netlists (data/bench/*.bench) are standard public-domain
test circuits widely distributed for research.
